13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385995 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 12 \\\\ 20 & -6\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385995 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385995 1084 #uuid "717307bb-59fe-545e-9a91-23b750fb8131" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385996 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 19 \\\\ -20 & -6\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385996 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385996 1084 #uuid "380fb730-0393-5e52-995e-a464ffd3e725" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385997 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 12 \\\\ -20 & -6\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385997 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385997 1084 #uuid "0adfadd9-3940-51df-8128-22b3445dc8a0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385998 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 12 \\\\ -20 & -26\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385998 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385998 1084 #uuid "e106e878-96ca-5444-8390-bf35e4e26521" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385999 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386000 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385999 1069 "q-102107" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385999 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385999 1071 "Which of the following number lines gives the solution to $-9<6-5x<1?$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385999 1072 #uuid "d786a9f1-6d9d-573d-9964-69c5e58662eb" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186385999 1074 "We isolate $x$ by applying the addition and multiplication principles, as usual. \n\nFirst, we apply the addition principle:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-9 & <6-5x<1 \\\\ -9-6 & <6-5x-6<1-6 \\\\ -15 & <-5x<-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we divide by $-5.$ Note that since we are dividing by a negative number, we need to flip the inequality signs. \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-15 & <-5x<-5 \\\\ \\frac{-15}{-5} & >\\frac{-5x}{-5}>\\frac{-5}{-5} \\\\ 3 & >x>1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution can be written as $3>x>1$, but this is somewhat difficult to read because the larger number is on the left rather than the right. So, we will rewrite the solution by reversing the order of the numbers: \n\n$$\n1<x<3\n$$\n\nWe can represent this solution using a number line, as follows.\n\n![](images/75/7547d4fa001c7bd0db9e6cd7751ba0da3cd4b65ef2fa4af6ea3c3fb80da55d8c.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386001 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386002 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386003 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386004 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386005 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386000 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386000 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386000 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386005 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386000 1080 #uuid "fed8e35e-747c-5bcf-bd41-34f49d6c1998" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386001 1081 "images/f8/f86ae3c5bc792bee8d0e798c0af7e81b24f156572c02b10773e19258e9913134.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386001 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386001 1084 #uuid "0eb1cb64-749e-5c74-b9e2-dfca460cca49" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386002 1081 "images/b6/b6ebfd08f792396eaa6d1018690b7685616c26ec8ca2824f754da7ca19069108.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386002 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386002 1084 #uuid "21c8aa15-2561-538b-adce-0e02db4b4536" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386003 1081 "images/12/120c8bbf904e4df194f0c4e614d5a1090ba0121ee7718571683c0c9ac9bb6b15.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386003 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386003 1084 #uuid "5e7c36df-a012-5449-8268-78c1a6036563" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386004 1081 "images/f3/f3d5c539ab5ce8d1820dc8627ddd981e6871ded73f10648bf02f8a03c3eb5185.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386004 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386004 1084 #uuid "679a6329-c800-5602-9eac-fcd84ed71642" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386005 1081 "images/75/7547d4fa001c7bd0db9e6cd7751ba0da3cd4b65ef2fa4af6ea3c3fb80da55d8c.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386005 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386005 1084 #uuid "affc140a-fce6-5c87-ae9e-69c582e2cba8" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386006 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386007 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386006 1069 "q-102320" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386006 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386006 1071 "Given the **orthonormal** basis $B={[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]}$ of ${R}^{2},$ find $[x]_{B}$ if $x=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386006 1072 #uuid "1c635af5-ba45-5ad9-a96d-e17304471ae7" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386006 1074 "Let's denote the vectors of $B$ as ${q}_{1},\\,{q}_{2}.$ \n\nSince $B$ is an orthonormal basis, we have that $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]$, where ${x}_{i}=x\\cdot {q}_{i}.$ Computing the components of $x,$ we get the following: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2}}-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ {x}_{2} & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2}}+\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{6}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386008 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386009 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386010 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386011 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386007 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386012 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386007 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386007 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386007 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386011 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386007 1080 #uuid "f4bec8a8-7bc7-5d93-87c4-53f78de8a9e4" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386008 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386008 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386008 1084 #uuid "79734ad1-3964-5f5e-9278-275bd9033da0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386009 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386009 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386009 1084 #uuid "ac89f61f-800f-5761-b7e6-5031550febb2" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386010 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386010 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386010 1084 #uuid "2e4613e8-6af0-5396-abab-11c25aa4f010" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386011 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{6}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386011 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386011 1084 #uuid "c4482992-608d-5931-8a49-e73ef737ee25" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386012 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ -\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386012 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386012 1084 #uuid "1e2076d2-dca0-5956-b3ba-ca1c44c69dcf" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386013 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386014 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386013 1069 "q-102365" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386013 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386013 1071 "Given that the differential equation\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}{y}^{″}+15x{y}^{′}+49y=0\n$$\n\nhas the general solution\n\n$$\ny={c}_{1}{x}^{-7}+{c}_{2}{x}^{-7}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x,\n$$\n\nsolve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}{y}^{″}+15x{y}^{′}+49y=0,\\,y(1)=1,\\,{y}^{′}(1)=1,\\,x>0.\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386013 1072 #uuid "b2f1e33b-97ff-5879-aa46-ccc76aa7159d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386013 1074 "We find the constants ${c}_{1}$ and ${c}_{2}$ using the initial conditions.\n\n- First, we apply the condition $y(1)=1.$ Substituting $y(1)=1$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\n1={c}_{1}.\n$$\n\n- Then, we apply the condition ${y}^{′}(1)=1.$ Differentiating $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′} & =-7{c}_{1}{x}^{-8}+{c}_{2}{x}^{-8}-7{c}_{2}{x}^{-8}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(1)=1$ and ${c}_{1}=1$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1 & =-7(1)+{c}_{2} \\\\ {c}_{2} & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(x) & ={x}^{-7}+8{x}^{-7}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{1+8\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{{x}^{7}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386015 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386016 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386017 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386018 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386019 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386014 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386014 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386014 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386018 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386014 1080 #uuid "46f0be38-8313-521b-b53a-affa294b3539" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386015 1081 "y(x)=\\frac{1-6\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{{x}^{7}}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386015 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386015 1084 #uuid "380571d6-ad52-5c32-9ec7-dfff8cf3080b" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386016 1081 "y(x)=\\frac{2-8\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{{x}^{7}}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386016 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386016 1084 #uuid "e21e0f1d-fc76-5b8e-802f-cf0520147a52" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386017 1081 "y(x)=\\frac{2-12\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{{x}^{7}}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386017 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386017 1084 #uuid "e2253b63-3223-5268-8ccd-867c548e6701" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386018 1081 "y(x)=\\frac{1+8\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{{x}^{7}}" 13194139533462 1759218604558