5585 true] [17592186386181 1072 #uuid "af5d832d-bffb-56c4-8e12-6440a08b81a3" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386181 1074 "We shall use the following identity:\n\n$$\n∇\\times (f\\,F)=f∇\\times F+∇f\\times F\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute $∇f\\times F.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f\\times F & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -2x & 1 & 0 \\\\ x & 0 & yz\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =[1(yz)-0(0)]i-[-2x(yz)-0(x)]j+[-2x(0)-1(x)]k \\\\  & =yz\\,i+2xyz\\,j-x\\,k \\\\  & =⟨yz,2xyz,-x⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\times (f\\,F) & =f∇\\times F+∇f\\times F \\\\  & =(y-{x}^{2})⟨z,0,0⟩+⟨yz,2xyz,-x⟩ \\\\  & =⟨z(y-{x}^{2}),0,0⟩+⟨yz,2xyz,-x⟩ \\\\  & =⟨z(2y-{x}^{2}),2xyz,-x⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\times (f\\,F)(0,2,-1) & =⟨(-1)(2(2)-(0)^{2}),2(0)(2)(-1),-0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4,0,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386182 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386183 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386182 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386184 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386182 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386185 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386182 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386186 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386182 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386187 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386182 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386182 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386182 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386184 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386182 1080 #uuid "2be98543-5eeb-59fa-92e7-b476092e5ae2" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386183 1081 "⟨0,-2,1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386183 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386183 1084 #uuid "9805af05-6995-560f-9ff6-9b1ba67e1079" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386184 1081 "⟨-4,0,0⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386184 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045