ing part is $X⇒(Y∧X).$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386243 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386244 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386243 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386245 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386243 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386246 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386243 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386247 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386243 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386248 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386243 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386243 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386243 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386246 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386243 1080 #uuid "ce2c47b3-4b13-5c76-8281-129d53bb3449" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386244 1081 "(Y∧X)⇒X" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386244 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386244 1084 #uuid "1ccbd211-37f6-5588-be49-c9e6a5031747" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386245 1081 "(Y∧X)⇒¬X" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386245 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386245 1084 #uuid "9a0c790e-5138-5350-8530-9f64b2b10d84" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386246 1081 "X⇒(Y∧X)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386246 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386246 1084 #uuid "3a965b62-601e-504b-b13a-33899cd8dcb6" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386247 1081 "¬X⇒¬(Y∧X)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386247 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386247 1084 #uuid "d0553cb0-ae4a-5751-895c-c22bd8bbac88" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386248 1081 "¬(Y∧X)⇒X" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386248 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386248 1084 #uuid "44f3dc52-dd9b-54d3-ad2b-d8147943ff3f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386249 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386250 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386249 1069 "q-107273" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386249 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386249 1071 "Find an eigenvector of $A=[\\begin{aligned}22 & -40 \\\\ -5 & 5\\end{aligned}]$ that corresponds to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =-3.$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386249 1072 #uuid "d5d9e801-eca8-5d4b-8b13-1bb066d0bb23" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386249 1074 "To compute the eigenvectors of a matrix, we need to find non-zero solutions of the matrix equation \n\n$$\n(A-\\lambda I)\\text{x}=0.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn our case, we have $\\,\\lambda =-3.$ So, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-\\lambda I & =[\\begin{aligned}22 & -40 \\\\ -5 & 5\\end{aligned}]-(-3)[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}25 & -40 \\\\ -5 & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the homogeneous system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}25{x}_{1}-40{x}_{2}=0 \\\\ -5{x}_{1}+8{x}_{2}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwith the augmented matrix $M$ which we reduce to row echelon form using Gaussian elimination, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}25 & -40 \\\\ -5 & 8\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+\\frac{1}{5}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}25 & -40 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the reduced matrix above, there is one pivot column (the $1$st one). Thus, ${x}_{2}$ is a free variable. \n\nFrom the first equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n25{x}_{1}-40{x}_{2}=0\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=\\frac{8}{5}{x}_{2}.\n$$\n\nHence, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{8}{5}{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nFinally, setting ${x}_{2}=5,$ we get the eigenvector \n\n$$\nv=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386250 1