4-bec01f1a2517" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386263 1074 "Let's simplify the expression using the properties of logical operation\n\n- First, we use that $X⇒Y≡¬X∨Y:$\n\n$$\nA∧(A⇒B)≡A∧(¬A∨B)\n$$\n\n- Then, we use the distributive law (disjunction over conjunction):\n\n$$\nA∧(¬A∨B)≡(A∧¬A)∨(A∧B)\n$$\n\n- Next,  we use the fact that the conjunction of a statement and its negation is a contradiction:\n\n$$\n(A∧¬A)∨(A∧B)≡c∨(A∧B)\n$$\n\n- Finally, we use the fact that the disjunction of a statement and a contradiction equals the original statement:\n\n$$\nc∨(A∧B)≡(A∧B)\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\nA∧(A⇒B)≡A∧B\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386265 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386266 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386267 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386268 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386269 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386264 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386264 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386264 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386268 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386264 1080 #uuid "514b2551-99d3-5459-b5ba-442ac38efc07" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386265 1081 "\\text{c}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386265 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386265 1084 #uuid "7ed4ecea-15f5-579d-898c-c643418469a4" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386266 1081 "A∨B" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386266 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386266 1084 #uuid "94142911-1105-539e-b373-1c6d5d7bbdbb" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386267 1081 "¬B" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386267 1083 #