 17592186045585 true] [17592186386295 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386299 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386295 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386300 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386295 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386295 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386295 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386299 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386295 1080 #uuid "3c87cef5-4fb2-5ed4-858a-b78c19a01a25" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386296 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386296 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386296 1084 #uuid "a7c051c9-1983-543b-bedb-dac6c1fe7e82" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386297 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386297 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386297 1084 #uuid "963e52b0-b4f9-5359-9c81-dbe8c9bd4990" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386298 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386298 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386298 1084 #uuid "4921e5a1-be99-5f04-9941-0df31b0b8add" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386299 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386299 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386299 1084 #uuid "4aa54289-df38-53db-b295-3a7809476d1e" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386300 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386300 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386300 1084 #uuid "d1a08320-c51f-5dd7-9d53-6740b2686f18" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386301 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386302 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386301 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386303 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386301 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386304 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386301 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386305 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386301 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386306 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386301 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386301 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386301 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386306 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386301 1080 #uuid "1868ed6f-a38d-5a16-93a8-ed4612cf63a6" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386302 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386302 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386302 1084 #uuid "e9deac94-910d-5b63-9e57-f2b87ce35388" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386303 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386303 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386303 1084 #uuid "1ed1599f-3aad-5db6-88b0-67ffb6cefac0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386304 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386304 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386304 1084 #uuid "a98ce391-9389-52eb-9e86-0f61cb9645c9" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386305 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386305 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386305 1084 #uuid "c1239255-deea-5186-b902-2c62a0e4f9b5" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386306 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386306 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386306 1084 #uuid "77e95aa7-899b-565b-8665-45a05cc48157" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386307 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386308 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386307 1069 "q-108839" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386307 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386307 1071 "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3}+{e}^{x-3y+2}.\n$$\n\n \nThe general solution to this equation can be expressed in the form\n\n$$\ng(x,y)=3x+C,\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is a constant. What is $g(x,y)?$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386307 1072 #uuid "be785dc0-3306-5ce6-93b4-08a0ff4dd41d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386307 1074 "First, we make the substitution\n\n$$\nz=x-3y.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $z(x)$ using the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}=1-3\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the original equation can be written in terms of $z$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{3}+{e}^{z+2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpressing this equation in the form ${z}^{′}(x)=f(z)$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}=-3{e}^{z+2}.\n$$\n\nThis differential equation is separable. So, we separate the variables and integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{3{e}^{z+2}}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x} & =1 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3}\\int {e}^{-(z+2)}\\,\\text{d}z & =\\int \\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\frac{{e}^{-(z+2)}}{3} & =x+K \\\\ {e}^{-(z+2)} & =3x+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=3K.$\n\nFinally, we write the equation in terms of $y$ and $x$ using our original substitution, as follows:\n\n$$\n{e}^{-(x-3y+2)}=3x+C\n$$\n\nTherefore, $g(x,y)={e}^{3y-x-2}.$" 13194139533462 