atorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v,\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v,\\,0⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′}(u,v) & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡v⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate these vectors when $u=\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ and $v=\\frac{\\pi }{2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =⟨-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}),\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}),\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\sqrt{3},\\,1,\\,0⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =⟨2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}),\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}),\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,0,\\,-2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a normal vector to the surface is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & ={r}_{u}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{2})\\times {r}_{v}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -\\sqrt{3} & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{3} & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,-2\\sqrt{3},\\,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the parameters $u=\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ and $v=\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ correspond to the point \n\n$$\n(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}),\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}),\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}))=(1,\\sqrt{3},0),\n$$\n\nthe equation of the tangent plane is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨-2,\\,-2\\sqrt{3},\\,0⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y-\\sqrt{3},\\,z⟩ & =0 \\\\ (-2)\\cdot (x-1)-2\\sqrt{3}\\cdot (y-\\sqrt{3})+0\\cdot z & =0 \\\\ -2x-2\\sqrt{3\\,}y+8 & =0 \\\\ -x-\\sqrt{3}\\,y+4 & =0 \\\\ x+\\sqrt{3}\\,y & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386466 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386467 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386466 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386468 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386466 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386469 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386466 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386470 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386466 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386471 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386466 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386466 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386466 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386470 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386466 1080 #uuid "0d400d17-55e0-5088-ac74-9581d46c3573" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386467 1081 "2\\sqrt{3}\\,x-y+z=4" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386467 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386467 1084 #uuid "e706ecae-308d-5092-af71-148298ad261a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386468 1081 "x+2\\sqrt{3}\\,y=6" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386468 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386468 1084 #uuid "a6cfb223-a85d-5193-bba6-6797f23009a1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386469 1081 "\\sqrt{3}\\,x+2z=1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386469 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386469 1084 #uuid "4483dceb-3874-510c-9a03-3469045925f5" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386470 1081 "x+\\sqrt{3}\\,y=4" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386470 1083 #edb/r