\\\  & =⟨0,\\,v,\\,2u⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′}(u,v) & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(1+v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(uv),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}({u}^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,u,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate these tangent vectors when $u=1$ and $v=1:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}(1,1) & =⟨0,\\,1,\\,2(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,1,\\,2⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′}(1,1) & =⟨1,\\,1,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a normal vector to the surface at the point $(2,1,1)$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & ={r}_{u}^{′}(1,1)\\times {r}_{v}^{′}(1,1) \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,2,\\,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386494 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386495 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386494 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386496 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386494 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386497 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386494 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386494 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386494 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386494 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386494 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386494 1080 #uuid "6d948195-cddc-5318-aa07-a4c321160f12" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386495 1081 "⟨-2,\\,1,\\,1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386495 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386495 1084 #uuid "b8a24b1f-31f1-543d-b84b-9cfea0445223" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386496 1081 "⟨-2,\\,0,\\,2⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386496 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386496 1084 #uuid "2cf68697-5cb8-50aa-a9cf-492e27294a0a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386497 1081 "⟨-1,\\,0,\\,-2⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386497 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386497 1084 #uuid "ca22b18c-c59c-5578-9309-f61f1efae923" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386498 1081 "⟨-1,\\,2,\\,1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386498 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386498 1084 #uuid "53bd0c50-2dc1-5382-9d3f-ed14cf1e80f7" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386499 1081 "⟨-2,\\,2,\\,-1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386499 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386499 1084 #uuid "2171ee27-89ba-5a6f-8e97-6b2e70582607" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386500 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386501 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386500 1069 "q-109942" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386500 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386500 1071 "Which of the following shaded areas describes the region bounded by the inequality $5x-10y<-20?$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386500 1072 #uuid "3626480d-f8b9-54d9-af65-fe6ef10bb1f3" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386500 1074 "First, we convert the inequality into slope-intercept form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x-10y & <-20 \\\\ -10y & <-5x-20 \\\\ 10y & >5x+20 \\\\ y & >\\frac{1}{2}x+2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we proceed as usual. We start by drawing the corresponding straight line $y=\\frac{1}{2}x+2.$ Since the inequality involves a 'strictly greater than' sign, the line $y=\\frac{1}{2}x+2$ itself is *not* part of the solution. Therefore, we draw a dashed line.\n\nThen, we need to decide whether to shade above or below the line. The inequality $y>\\frac{1}{2}x+2$ refers to the $y$-values that are *greater than* those on the line $y=\\frac{1}{2}x+2,$ so we shade *above* the line.\n\n![](images/35/351bb4b4324432e2cc747e67dac22100da3c9e5318339832efa046f504394c35.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386502 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386503 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386504 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386505 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386501 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386506 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386501 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386501 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386501 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386506 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386501 1080 #uuid "56cf31dd-5756-5666-b3b0-415b7baf39bd" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386502 1081 "images/1e/1e408923db2c7223715b9f82a2777a411e2c79b3614320975c237f2f503f2368.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386502 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386502 1084 #uuid "2d272ed1-e481-5274-b5b3-9ee482390899" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386503 1081 "images/45/458a5dd519867a662237d7b52e44627d1867f25dcceeea446203a42571f91a00.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386503 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386503 1084 #uuid "314c8fa8-fac6-5a5a-8685-cfb75d2ef5b2" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386504 1081 "images/06/0668624761edfaf6f67a69d6059e7b0c54acd87042ec9f7400f1d4c2dfc5ff0b.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386504 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386504 1084 #uuid "54171b3e-5c85-5a7c-99c4-2b8f08fab4bb" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386505 1081 "images/eb/ebf7fd57f5d07afebc22899418ce34d14e59dcdb2a01087950d