77 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386677 1084 #uuid "96e6fd33-b036-50c8-a86d-2ed4364a0dc8" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386678 1081 "images/6c/6c4c728e59e416a589b85318988a3a87e2a3c9445b669c4091301b21254c87fa.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386678 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386678 1084 #uuid "46d1074a-2a76-523e-ac49-c7030b1d984d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386679 1081 "images/46/4612933db2d25ce80b7e7258d3e381fd03f951246b515c3c34c69b71c537c7fc.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386679 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386679 1084 #uuid "50a3028f-ed6c-5718-a36a-947dbee62ad0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386680 1081 "images/d1/d14d6a75f24afea6dfe31aed9dc752b470c6d672b6a3c0f97820738b6140e629.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386680 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386680 1084 #uuid "71df20dc-d7fc-5b41-be17-a6983196a882" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386681 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386682 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386681 1069 "q-113415" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386681 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386681 1071 "The change-of-coordinates matrix from the basis $B$ to the basis $C$ is given by \n${P}_{B\\to C}=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & 1 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{aligned}].$\nFind the change-of-coordinates matrix from $C$ to $B$  ." 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386681 1072 #uuid "0e492abb-150e-5b29-ab40-6db339f73d6b" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386681 1074 "The change-of-coordinates matrix from $C$ to $B$ is the inverse of the change-of-coordinates matrix from $B$ to $C.$ Therefore, we simply need to find the inverse of the given matrix.\n\nComputing the inverse of ${P}_{B\\to C}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{C\\to B} & ={P}_{B\\to C}^{-1} \\\\  & ={[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & 1 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{aligned}]}^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot (-1)-1\\cdot (-2)}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & \\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =2\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & \\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -2 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386682 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386683 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386682 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386684 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386682 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386685 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386682 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386686 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386682 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386687 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386682 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386682 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386682 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386683 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386682 1080 #uuid "9f7670fd-c5bc-51f7-98ba-bd3ac9cdc072" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386683 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -2 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386683 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386683 1084 #uuid "919eb1e9-2f4b-56b6-88e5-3859874737bb" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386684 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386684 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386684 1084 #uuid "90eeb8b6-e3b5-53db-a5fe-f9746d4ccb88" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386685 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-4 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386685 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386685 1084 #uuid "b872c