 =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4{x}^{3}+16x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{x}^{3}+16x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot (12{x}^{2}+16).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can substitute the given information $\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}=-\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\text{cm}/\\text{s}$ and $x=3$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t} & =(-\\frac{1}{4})\\cdot (12\\cdot (3)^{2}+16)\\,\\text{cm}/\\text{s} \\\\  & =-31\\,\\text{cm}/\\text{s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386799 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386800 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386799 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386801 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386799 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386802 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386799 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386803 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386799 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386804 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386799 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386799 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386799 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386803 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386799 1080 #uuid "961c57b3-a998-5144-856a-ae1bafc705a0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386800 1081 "-33\\,\\text{cm}/\\text{s}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386800 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386800 1084 #uuid "5a48076b-7b90-5465-8260-9c51c1045958" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386801 1081 "-36\\,\\text{cm}/\\text{s}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386801 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386801 1084 #uuid "80be3fba-ad80-501f-8fa3-33d704081cdc" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386802 1081 "-12\\,\\text{cm}/\\text{s}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [175921863