$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (-4{e}^{2x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =-4\\int {e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-4(\\frac{{e}^{2x}}{2}) \\\\  & =-2{e}^{2x}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now plot the solution curves by selecting different values for $C.$ The sketch below shows the solution curves for $C=-2,0,2.$\n\n![](images/cc/cc2ee25a85be3ffdb055853f7665bd53d34003a74b96a14bb947bed39b18e83f.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386910 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386911 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386910 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386912 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386910 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386913 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386910 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386914 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386910 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386915 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386910 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386910 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386910 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386913 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386910 1080 #uuid "5dd2a4ff-6ada-5a27-9174-b3c1a697aa04" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386911 1081 "images/4a/4acfee397d2c301aa7d005c8467319969bdfe1a487c284e51024a1851ef8a2e3.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386911 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386911 1084 #uuid "cdbca57f-16aa-507a-9243-fc5de6668bda" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386912 1081 "images/0e/0e2d84423e017f6d126ef6b997a50d62a7de30f91c24aa64f2525ce4ae33cdd3.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386912 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386912 1084 #uuid "0e615e5e-edb5-5cf5-9379-57b9b7c05caa" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386913 1081 "images/14/146aa5565c845f3fbfa66e6c215224236869199844cdbe51f2671c781b1c3705.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17