8 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386976 1084 #uuid "e17b3836-865c-519c-88f1-9b2ec1f1d16a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386977 1081 "images/9c/9cb42cde56fcbea0c489742cab1448890728dab584395129b21794115b1e1298.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386977 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386977 1084 #uuid "373395c0-c96b-52a6-9531-5a58b40d8884" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386978 1081 "images/96/96817ea42e1d860db97d3ee6bca79e9a8b03a0fd413c87ebc5679f746da3166b.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386978 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386978 1084 #uuid "48347676-3575-5e72-90f7-c8cf10b0c6a7" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386979 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386980 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386979 1069 "q-120078" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386979 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386979 1071 "![](images/8b/8b618c8e43dbe898a6e1c481f4f887a50bc2e8c658368876be11ec5ea269a50c.png)\n\nA company produces a chocolate bar that comes in an triangular-prism-shaped box. In the figure, the areas of some of the faces are displayed in a net of the prism. What is the total surface area of the box?" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386979 1072 #uuid "2c2645ff-704d-5d0e-a816-127a2f8fd501" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386979 1074 "The surface area of our prism consists of $2$ triangles (base and top) and $3$ rectangles (central and side faces). \n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Surface area} & =2\\times (\\text{Area of the base})+2\\times (\\text{Area of the side faces}) \\\\  & +1\\times (\\text{Area of the central face}) \\\\  & =2\\times 36+2\\times 72+108 \\\\  & =72+144+108 \\\\  & =324\\,{\\text{cm}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386980 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386981 13194