on our diagram, we shade in the solutions to $f(x,y)\\le 0$ using the *last* column of the table above.\n\n![](images/20/206cc195b55db8f3793f4d84d0bd3b78f21430759770c8be4c815f8db8d562fb.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387085 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387086 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387087 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387088 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387089 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387084 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387084 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387084 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387085 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387084 1080 #uuid "82206e3f-a393-55e4-9c7a-d0f6c1ac5063" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387085 1081 "images/d9/d996ae0305472b14d52d3ec951669590aad2a249a3ce2f2643d65ad17993a899.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387085 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387085 1084 #uuid "d4457c61-79cf-5b6b-9f7d-2a64aa1620cc" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387086 1081 "images/ec/ec94dbaaf4cc906de62faa9c2eea1ca9028915377f18ff5bf4aa5bd8d53b2df2.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387086 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387086 1084 #uuid "615dd0c2-a153-520e-874d-9a7ca0cdfb3f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387087 1081 "images/10/10080518e756d9d915dadc4346c23a9db90ff7d0f8df90b09f571b3f9f8aa29c.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387087 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387087 1084 #uuid "cc85e982-0cd2-5e9b-bb8b-963b7d7fd543" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387088 1081 "images/91/91ec230c1251255ad019b445ba18bc35cf46ebf5fceaac74a359ecd819e5ec1d.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387088 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387088 1084 #uuid "e3641bd9-8933-5d72-9a3e-69c90c0b9b7c" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387089 1081 "images/74/74cb28a25b133ac6ce3b5abcccef89620350ca901fd60ec66888ed7fee454e18.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387089 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387089 1084 #uuid "1b27f675-bc47-500a-bbf3-2a7e3d600088" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387090 1068 #edb/ref 17592186387091 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387090 1069 "q-121424" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387090 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387090 1071 "![](images/a9/a928b14cfe88f9aaf7b8cf5288a18f3e81e163ea65fd3a48653fcba630c11386.png)\n\nWhich integral gives the area of the finite region bounded by $y=8{x}^{2}-5$ and $y=1-2x,$ shown above?\n\n*(Note: Figure not drawn to scale)*" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387090 1072 #uuid "8b0cb8d7-3e11-5e09-bfb8-3963a1210c8e" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387090 1074 "The diagram shows that the intersection points between the two graphs occur when $x=-1$ and $x=\\frac{3}{4}.$ So these will be our limits of integration.\n\nTo determine which is the lower function and which is the upper, let's draw our vertical arrow.\n\n![](images/22/226ade4a3b546484ba2e9ce5f266391fb51e9fe4b62e2e78d12200ac54ecea9a.png)\n\nThe vertical line \n\n- *enters* the region through the lower function $y=8{x}^{2}-5,$ and\n\n- *leaves* through the upper function $y=1-2x.$\n\nTherefore, the integral that gives our area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}[\\,(\\text{upper function})-(\\text{lower function})\\,]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}[\\,(1-2x)-(8{x}^{2}-5)\\,]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}-2x+6)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387091 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387092 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387091 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387093 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387091 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387094 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387091 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387095 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387091 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387096 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387091 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387091 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387091 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387096 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387091 1080 #uuid "fabea5bd-4133-591e-b119-1b3b4af303a7" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387092 1081 "{\\int }_{-1/4}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}-2x+1)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387092 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387092 1084 #uuid "b9e07dc2-1609-5e79-a646-1a35fc112393" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387093 1081 "{\\int }_{1}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}+x+5)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387093 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387093 1084 #uuid "08451189-0f9c-544a-bf3c-0ed9bc4de695" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387094 1081 "{\\int }_{-1/3}^{3/4}(-{x}^{2}-2x+6)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387094 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387094 1084 #uuid "339fabab-5d9c-5f67-a828-7b2be5058246" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387095 1081 "{\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}(8{x}^{2}-x-4)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387095 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387095 1084 #uuid "6c4d99b7-abbf-597b-a573-795fd8eb1add" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387096 1081 "{\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}-2x+6)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387096 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387096 1084 #uuid "22b4d77b-f8fd-5693-8621-84c84313567a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387097 1068 #edb/ref 17592186387098 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387097 1069 "q-121517" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387097 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387097 1071 "Which integral gives the area of the finite region bounded between $y=8{x}^{2}-4$ and $y=2-2x?$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387097 1072 #uuid "1495ffd4-708e-5569-a19d-b4ce8001edba" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387097 1074 "First, let's draw a sketch of the two functions.\n\n![](images/b2/b2f34492ce184169d0e720d5a2214a356236b56d6e20bd8ece584b967f074e64.png)\n\n*(Note: Figure not drawn to scale)*\n\nNow, we want to determine the limits of integration. To do this, we equate the two functions and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2-2x & =8{x}^{2}-4 \\\\ 8{x}^{2}+2x-6 & =0 \\\\ x & =\\frac{-2\\pm \\sqrt{{2}^{2}-4\\cdot 8\\cdot (-6)}}{2\\cdot 8} \\\\  & =\\frac{-2\\pm 14}{16}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we need to integrate from $x=-1$ to $x=\\frac{3}{4}.$\n\nTo determine which is the lower function and which is the upper, let's draw our vertical arrow.\n\n![](images/94/94243d27b465eca7957731385b2fe13fae36b811079d3077e2e093aa19d81ad3.png)\n\nThe vertical line \n\n- *enters* the region through the lower function $y=8{x}^{2}-4,$ and\n\n- *leaves* through the upper function $y=2-2x.$\n\nTherefore, the integral that gives our area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}[\\,(\\text{upper function})-(\\text{lower function})\\,]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}[\\,(2-2x)-(8{x}^{2}-4)\\,]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}-2x+6)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387098 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387099 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387098 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387100 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387098 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387101 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387098 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387102 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387098 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387103 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387098 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387098 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387098 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387103 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387098 1080 #uuid "337e69ec-98d4-58b7-86e9-081e8f92fe8e" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387099 1081 "{\\int }_{-2}^{3/4}(-{x}^{2}+2x-6)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387099 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387099 1084 #uuid "56e672f5-dce5-5fa6-adcd-1a961d81744a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387100 1081 "{\\int }_{-1/4}^{3/4}(8{x}^{2}+x-3)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387100 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387100 1084 #uuid "4ba0933e-b635-5c29-8f6c-2e1fff10756f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387101 1081 "{\\int }_{3/4}^{1}(-8{x}^{2}-3x+2)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387101 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387101 1084 #uuid "626d6993-64e2-51a1-8455-31c14edbc69d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387102 1081 "{\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}(-4{x}^{2}-x+4)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387102 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387102 1084 #uuid "fdd1781d-6f2f-5da6-8c71-74484a0b86d8" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387103 1081 "{\\int }_{-1}^{3/4}(-8{x}^{2}-2x+6)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387103 10