need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{5\\cdot (-1)-(-2)\\cdot 2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{-1}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387325 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387326 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387325 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387327 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387325 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387328 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387325 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387329 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387325 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387330 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387325 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387325 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387325 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387326 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387325 1080 #uuid "299f6ec7-a02a-58c0-aab8-a90cf14d427a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387326 1081 "x=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387326 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387326 1084 #uuid "5a82d5f6-66f3-5522-a100-e2f8dae13966" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387327 1081 "x=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387327 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387327 1084 #uuid "629adac7