\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{x}^{2}\\,\\frac{dx}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t+xy\\,\\frac{dy}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}({x}^{2}\\,\\frac{dx}{\\text{d}t}+xy\\,\\frac{dy}{\\text{d}t})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)^{2}\\cdot (-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)+(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}-8{cos}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2{cos}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-6{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{cos}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387541 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387542 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387543 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387544 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387545 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387540 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387540 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387540 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387543 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387540 1080 #uuid "46e3edf1-c65d-5b40-9b5a-4947c9652286" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387541 1081 "6{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387541 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387541 1084 #uuid "c2f1d0a0-f937-5c5a-a906-b8d8c3476536" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387542 1081 "-2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{cos}^{2}⁡t{sin}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387542 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387542 1084 #uuid "b7352c23-717f-5780-b0