igned}N(t) & =\\frac{{T}^{′}(t)}{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}=\\frac{\\frac{2}{{(1+4{t}^{2})}^{3/2}}⟨-2t,\\,0,\\,1⟩}{(\\frac{2}{1+4{t}^{2}})}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+4{t}^{2}}}⟨-2t,\\,0,\\,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the binormal vector, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B(t) & =T(t)\\times N(t) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+4{t}^{2}}}⟨1,0,2t⟩\\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+4{t}^{2}}}⟨-2t,\\,0,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+4{t}^{2}}\\,\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2t \\\\ -2t & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+4{t}^{2}}[\\text{ }\\left|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2t \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,i-\\left|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2t \\\\ -2t & 1\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,j+\\left|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -2t & 0\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k\\text{ }] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+4{t}^{2}}⟨0-0,-(1+4{t}^{2}),0-0⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+4{t}^{2}}⟨0,\\,-(1+4{t}^{2}),\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,-1,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387824 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387825 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387824 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387826 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387824 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387827 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387824 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387828 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387824 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387829 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387824 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387824 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387824 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387829 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387824 1080 #uuid "b39d1a04-3d20-5a50-851c-2b9dd049f9b6" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387825 1081 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+8{t}^{2}}}⟨2t,\\,2t,\\,-1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387825 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387825 1084 #uuid "1693bed9-d0f0-55b1-b740-a527cbeb53ff" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387826 1081 