f115840" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387865 1074 "By the sum rule, we have\n\n$$\n(f(t)+g(t))^{′}={f}^{′}(t)+{g}^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find the derivatives of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-2t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}((t-1)^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,2t,\\,2(t-1)⟩ \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t+1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-2t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{3})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-2,\\,3{t}^{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f(t)+g(t))^{′} & ={f}^{′}(t)+{g}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,2t,\\,2t-2⟩+⟨1,\\,-2,\\,3{t}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,2t-2,\\,3{t}^{2}+2t-2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387866 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387867 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387866 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387868 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387866 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387869 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387866 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387870 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387866 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387871 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387866 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387866 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387866 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387871 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387866 1080 #uuid "437f6985-a5fd-5604-8d5e-718379fa984b" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387867 1081 "⟨-2,\\,-2t,\\,2t-2⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387867 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387867 1084 #uuid "a768cdba-762c-56fa-9c5a-e7c147a0278c" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387868 1081 "⟨-1,\\,2t,\\,{t}^{2}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387868 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387868 1084 #uuid "308ec3e7-6