true] [17592186388026 1074 "First, notice that: \n\n- For the plane $2x=6$, a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{1}=⟨2,0,0⟩.$\n\n- For the plane $z=1-y$ (or $y+z=1$), a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{2}=⟨0,1,1⟩.$\n\nTo find a direction vector for the line, we calculate the cross product of these normal vectors:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & ={n}_{1}\\times {n}_{2} \\\\  & =⟨2,0,0⟩\\times ⟨0,1,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-2j+2k \\\\  & =⟨0,-2,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388027 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388028 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388027 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388029 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388027 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388030 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388027 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388031 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388027 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388032 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388027 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388027 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388027 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388030 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388027 1080 #uuid "8224c570-9b5e-580f-8450-ee7ed8cf16e9" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388028 1081 "⟨2,-2,1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388028 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388028 1084 #uuid "e9137657-ea64-55ac-a50c-776389fe269a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388029 1081 "⟨-2,1,2⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388029 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388029 1084 #uuid "ccb2d8a9-4b43-5c1d-a4f4-5266329e7446" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388030 1081 "⟨0,-2,2⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388030 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388030 1084 #uu