0 1071 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨8,\\,-4,\\,4⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{3}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨4,\\,-2,\\,2⟩.$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388040 1072 #uuid "cec9543d-3be0-5419-a7dd-c01379498092" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388040 1074 "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{3}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{3}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{3}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨8,\\,-4,\\,4⟩-⟨4,\\,-2,\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,-2,\\,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388042 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388043 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388044 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388045 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388041 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388046 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388041 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388041 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388041 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388044 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388041 1080 #uuid "f6776540-2b3d-5297-905d-0e8c15e5c16c" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388042 1081 "⟨4,\\,1,\\,1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388042 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388042 1084 #uuid "c21f973b-6827-55c5-baa5-2565f439cc1d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388043 1081 "⟨-4,\\,2,\\,1⟩" 13194139533462 1759218