 =⟨0,-1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the Cartesian equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(1,-1)\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y-(-1)⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨0,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388083 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388084 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388083 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388085 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388083 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388086 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388083 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388087 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388083 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388088 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388083 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388083 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388083 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388088 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388083 1080 #uuid "b68b09e4-9252-5d68-ab26-fe3cc2a6e217" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388084 1081 "⟨1,0⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩=0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388084 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388084 1084 #uuid "8440b232-2d79-53cd-bad6-36fe06f0e97a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388085 1081 "⟨-1,0⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩=0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388085 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388085 1084 #uuid "fec3679d-d002-508a-b44e-896ae847115f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388086 1081 "⟨-1,1⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩=0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388086 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388086 1084 #uuid "d41769d3-a85e-5a1d-b0d2-621fb6f6adf3" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388087 1081 "⟨1,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1⟩=0" 13194139533462 1759218604