7592186045585 true] [17592186388236 1074 "We shall use the following identity:\n\n$$\n∇\\times (f\\,F)=f∇\\times F+∇f\\times F\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute $∇f\\times F.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f\\times F & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & {z}^{2} & 2yz \\\\ 0 & x & 2\\sqrt{y}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =[({z}^{2})(2\\sqrt{y})-(x)(2yz)]i-[(0)(2\\sqrt{y})-(0)(2yz)]j+[(0)(x)-(0)({z}^{2})]k \\\\  & =(2{z}^{2}\\sqrt{y}-2xyz)\\,i+0\\,j+0\\,k \\\\  & =⟨2{z}^{2}\\sqrt{y}-2xyz,0,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\times (f\\,F) & =f∇\\times F+∇f\\times F \\\\  & =(y{z}^{2})⟨\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{y}},0,1⟩+⟨2{z}^{2}\\sqrt{y}-2xyz,0,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{z}^{2}\\sqrt{y},0,y{z}^{2}⟩+⟨2{z}^{2}\\sqrt{y}-2xyz,0,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3{z}^{2}\\sqrt{y}-2xyz,0,y{z}^{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n∇\\times (f\\,F)(0,4,1)=⟨6,0,4⟩.\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388238 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388239 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388240 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388241 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388237 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388242 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388237 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388237 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388237 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388241 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388237 1080 #uuid "a833e095-384d-5aee-ba9d-4109718fd7e4" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388238 1081 "⟨-2,0,4⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388238 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388238 1084 #uuid "c02f7910-0f1e-5f8a-9778-404bff2b97a2" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388239 1081 "⟨1,-4,3⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186388239 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139